        epoch: Option<&str>,
        after: Option<u64>,
        vt_snapshot: bool,
        observer: bool,
    ) -> Result<TerminaldAttachStream, TerminaldClientError> {
        self.attach_with_resume_mode(id, epoch, after, true, vt_snapshot, observer)
